  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote Reading Fellows for Left-behind Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program is to make remote reading education available for the left-behind children who study in elementary school in poor areas of China. As reading fellows, volunteers will record children audiobooks, using their voices to send care, raise their interest of reading, develop literacy skills and get inspiration from the content. We will also complement cartoon booksmarks, physical books, portable audio players and e-education materials for schools to formalize the reading education course.</narrative>
  </description>
